WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,560
This last dish is a hidden menu specially ordered for you.

2
00:00:02,560 --> 00:00:04,240
You usually can’t even eat what you want.

3
00:00:04,240 --> 00:00:05,560
What is it

4
00:00:05,560 --> 00:00:09,910
fresh brains

5
00:00:09,910 --> 00:00:11,470
I heard it's delicious

6
00:00:11,470 --> 00:00:13,640
But I'm not used to this

7
00:00:13,640 --> 00:00:17,080
When things are served, nothing is wasted.

8
00:00:17,080 --> 00:00:19,610
You just don't give me face

9
00:00:19,610 --> 00:00:21,930
Why are there still people who buy and sell by force?

10
00:00:21,930 --> 00:00:27,770
People Where are people?

11
00:00:27,770 --> 00:00:29,290
What should I do to save it?

12
00:00:29,290 --> 00:00:30,570
As soon as the ghost dies suddenly, he sits across from you

13
00:00:30,570 --> 00:00:32,370
If something bad happens, you have to eat the brains out.

14
00:00:32,370 --> 00:00:34,610
But if you eat it, you will definitely die.

15
00:00:34,610 --> 00:00:35,850
I'll inform the captain

16
00:00:35,850 --> 00:00:46,910
Damn it, why don't you eat it?

17
00:00:46,910 --> 00:00:48,310
this is impossible

18
00:00:48,310 --> 00:00:50,900
It's not polluted at all

19
00:00:50,900 --> 00:00:52,380
Is brain flower delicious?

20
00:00:52,380 --> 00:00:53,380
I can't get used to it

21
00:00:53,380 --> 00:00:55,700
I still prefer fat beef and baby cabbage.

22
00:00:55,700 --> 00:00:57,250
Who asked you this?

23
00:00:57,250 --> 00:00:59,370
This human being can really drop the topic

24
00:00:59,370 --> 00:01:01,780
Boss, keep eating slowly

25
00:01:01,780 --> 00:01:03,100
I'm done eating. Let's go now.
